{"1154090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kingdom Shell", "steam_appid": 1154090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [2696700], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/extras/424de405dab5d814db387a1e4d5a5816.apng?t=1745491282\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/extras/424de405dab5d814db387a1e4d5a5816.poster.avif?t=1745491282\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=138 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The magical Shell that has protected the Kingdom for centuries has been shattered. Hordes of nightmarish creatures now overrun the Kingdom, terrorizing its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The White Temple, which has stood guard over the Kingdom for centuries, cannot face this threat alone. They are forced to seek help from Elias, a half-blood in whose veins flows the blood of nightmares. He may be the Kingdom's only hope. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the lands of the Kingdom, fight hordes of nightmarish creatures and powerful bosses, find secrets, help inhabitants in distress and stop the impending catastrophe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/extras/20165c0160f258a7f1a8a89b4d6058ae.poster.avif?t=1745491282\" width=616 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/extras/20165c0160f258a7f1a8a89b4d6058ae.webm?t=1745491282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/extras/20165c0160f258a7f1a8a89b4d6058ae.mp4?t=1745491282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover the world of the Kingdom, rich in lore and atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Stunning hand-drawn pixel art and animation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage your foes up close, executing impressive combos, dodge attacks, and strike them with a variety of spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Meet the inhabitants of the Kingdom. Some of them have rumors that can be investigated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Engage in challenging and intriguing boss fights, with over a dozen in the game, including secret bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the Kingdom's world, filled with hidden places and mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find items, spells, and abilities to aid you in your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize your playstyle with the inspiration system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/extras/a3ec7200d15a804aa282e8296a9e2bed.poster.avif?t=1745491282\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/extras/a3ec7200d15a804aa282e8296a9e2bed.webm?t=1745491282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/extras/a3ec7200d15a804aa282e8296a9e2bed.mp4?t=1745491282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/extras/424de405dab5d814db387a1e4d5a5816.apng?t=1745491282\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/extras/424de405dab5d814db387a1e4d5a5816.poster.avif?t=1745491282\" class=\"bb