 in the game, including secret bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the Kingdom's world, filled with hidden places and mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Find items, spells, and abilities to aid you in your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Customize your playstyle with the inspiration system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/extras/a3ec7200d15a804aa282e8296a9e2bed.poster.avif?t=1745491282\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/extras/a3ec7200d15a804aa282e8296a9e2bed.webm?t=1745491282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/extras/a3ec7200d15a804aa282e8296a9e2bed.mp4?t=1745491282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Kingdom Shell is an atmospheric 2D platformer with a captivating storyline. Explore the local lands to stop the invasion of nightmarish creatures and unravel the mysteries of the Kingdom.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/header.jpg?t=1745491282", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745491282", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1154090/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745491282", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.2 Ghz or superior<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Hardware Acce